{"seq":3,"slug":"variable-height","title":"不定高与测量：估算、测量、前缀和、二分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/variable-height","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"不定高与测量-估算-测量-前缀和-二分\">不定高与测量：估算、测量、前缀和、二分</h1><p>真实内容很少愿意等高。一条动态可能一行也可能十行，一个卡片可能带图也可能纯文本，评论有长有短。此时你在渲染之前根本不知道每项多高，定高那套 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\cdot H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘法全部失效。不定高虚拟化的整套机制，就是围绕「如何在不知道全部高度的前提下，仍能维持正确的偏移与总高」展开的——答案是一个「先估算、渲染后测量、把测量值累进前缀和、再用二分反查」的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>不定高的困境是个先有鸡还是先有蛋的问题：要算窗口得知道各项偏移，要知道偏移得知道各项高度，要知道高度得先渲染，要渲染又得先算窗口。破解办法是引入<strong>估算高度</strong>打破循环：一开始假设每项高度等于一个估算值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用它算出初始窗口并渲染；渲染后用 <code>ResizeObserver</code> 或 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 测出真实高度，写入缓存；下次窗口计算就用「已测量项的真值 + 未测量项的估算值」。随着用户滚动，越来越多项被测量，偏移与总高逐步逼近真实。</p>\n<p>为了让「求第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项偏移」和「由 scrollTop 反查索引」都保持高效，用前缀和数组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i] = \\sum_{j&lt;i} h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项的偏移。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i) = P[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查询，而由滚动位置反查索引是在单调递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 上做二分查找，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[初始: 全部项用估算高度 h_hat] --&gt; B[算窗口并渲染 start..end]&#10;  B --&gt; C[ResizeObserver 测量已渲染项真实高度]&#10;  C --&gt; D{测量值与缓存不同?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[更新高度缓存 + 前缀和]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[无需更新]&#10;  E --&gt; G[修正 totalSize 与后续 offset]&#10;  G --&gt; H[必要时做滚动锚定校正]&#10;  F --&gt; I[窗口稳定]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[初始: 全部项用估算高度 h_hat] --&gt; B[算窗口并渲染 start..end]\n  B --&gt; C[ResizeObserver 测量已渲染项真实高度]\n  C --&gt; D{测量值与缓存不同?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[更新高度缓存 + 前缀和]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[无需更新]\n  E --&gt; G[修正 totalSize 与后续 offset]\n  G --&gt; H[必要时做滚动锚定校正]\n  F --&gt; I[窗口稳定]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>不定高实现里三种「高度来源」的层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>高度来源</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局估算值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>尚未渲染过的项</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组/类型估算</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>已知项类型但未测量</td>\n<td>需维护类型表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实测缓存值</td>\n<td>高（真值）</td>\n<td>已渲染并测量过的项</td>\n<td>测量 + 存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"估算值的选择为何重要\">估算值的选择为何重要</h2><p>估算值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不影响最终正确性（测量后都会被真值取代），但强烈影响体验。估算得越准，未测量区域的 totalSize 越接近真实，滚动条长度越稳定，跳动越小。如果估算严重偏离——比如估 40px 实际平均 200px——滚动条会在滚动过程中剧烈伸缩，用户拖着滚动条却发现位置一直在变。实践建议：用真实数据的高度中位数或平均值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，若项有明显类型差异（带图/不带图）就按类型给不同估算值。TanStack Virtual 的 <code>estimateSize</code> 选项正是干这个的（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtual-libraries\">库 (TanStack Virtual)</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测量的时机与工具\">测量的时机与工具</h2><p>测量必须发生在渲染之后，且不能阻塞滚动。首选工具是 <code>ResizeObserver</code>：给每个渲染出的项挂上观察，项的尺寸一变化就异步回调上报，天然处理了「图片加载完撑高」「内容异步变化」这类情形。次选是渲染后在 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 或 effect 里用 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 批量测一遍。要极力避免的是在滚动回调里同步读取几何——那会触发强制同步布局，把滚动性能毁掉（机制见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">布局与回流</a>）。测量结果要缓存起来，理想的缓存是可增量更新的结构，改一项高度只需更新它之后的前缀和，而不是全量重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前缀和的增量维护与二分查找\">前缀和的增量维护与二分查找</h2><p>朴素地维护前缀和数组，改动第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 项高度要重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[k..N]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，最坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当高度频繁被测量修正时这会成为瓶颈。工程上有两条路：一是接受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 但配合「脏区间」批处理，多个测量攒一批再统一重算一次；二是用树状数组（Fenwick tree）或线段树把「单点更新」和「前缀和查询」都做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。由滚动位置反查索引则是在前缀和上二分：找最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i] \\le scrollTop</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，就是可视区顶部的项。二分要求前缀和单调，而高度非负天然保证这一点。对于大多数几千到几万项的列表，简单前缀和 + 批处理已经够用；到十万级、且高度频繁变动，才值得上树状数组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测量修正与跳动的连锁\">测量修正与跳动的连锁</h2><p>不定高最棘手的副作用是：当你修正了「当前视口上方」某项的高度（比如它比估算高了 60px），该项之上的所有偏移都要顺移，包括当前正在看的内容——如果不做补偿，视口内容就会突然向下窜 60px，这就是滚动跳动。因此测量修正必须和滚动位置补偿配对：修正上方高度的同时，把 <code>scrollTop</code> 也调整等量，使视口里用户正在看的项纹丝不动。这套锚定逻辑是不定高能否落地的成败关键，本篇只点出它与测量的因果，完整机制见 <a href=\"../techniques/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>不定高的核心闭环：估算打破鸡生蛋 → 渲染 → 测量 → 写入前缀和 → 二分反查索引。</li>\n<li>前缀和让 offset 查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、由 scrollTop 反查索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；高度非负保证单调可二分。</li>\n<li>估算值不影响正确性但决定滚动条稳定性，用数据的中位数/分类型估算。</li>\n<li>测量走 <code>ResizeObserver</code> 异步回收，严禁在滚动热路径同步读几何。</li>\n<li>修正上方项高度必须配对滚动位置补偿，否则产生跳动——这引出下一章的锚定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"fixed-height\">定高虚拟化</a> — 定高是本篇在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i \\equiv H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 时的特例。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../techniques/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a> — 测量修正引发跳动的完整对策。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../practice/virtual-libraries\">库 (TanStack Virtual)</a> — <code>estimateSize</code> 与 <code>measureElement</code> 如何封装本篇逻辑。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a> — 另一实现视角的测量缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不定高与测量：估算、测量、前缀和、二分","id":"不定高与测量-估算-测量-前缀和-二分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"估算值的选择为何重要","id":"估算值的选择为何重要"},{"level":2,"text":"测量的时机与工具","id":"测量的时机与工具"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀和的增量维护与二分查找","id":"前缀和的增量维护与二分查找"},{"level":2,"text":"测量修正与跳动的连锁","id":"测量修正与跳动的连锁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"定高虚拟化：所有算式都退化成乘除法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/fixed-height"},"next":{"title":"节点回收与池化：让 DOM 节点数恒定且稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/node-recycling"}}